				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>ⓘ All of our leagues are <a href="https://www.londonfa.com/play/youth-boys/small-sided" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FA affiliated</a> and include:</p><p><b>✅ Player stats: </b>Assists, Goals, Caps &amp; MOMs stats recorded by the ref and published live</p><p><strong><b>✅ </b>Team pages</strong> with stats (compete with team mates!)</p><p><strong><b>✅ </b>Player profiles</strong> with Goals, MOMs, Caps, Clean sheets, Assists-to-match ratio, Goal-to-match ratio stats (compete with the rest of the league and all leagues!)</p><p><span style="font-weight: bold;">✅ Player awards</span> (and hall of fame): Golden Boot, Most Creative (most assists), Goalkeeper of the Season &amp; Player of the Season</p><p><strong><b>✅ </b>Champions team</strong> trophy, medals, bottle of fizz at the end of season ceremony</p><p><b>✅  Pitch side scoreboard</b>/timer (no more asking the ref!)</p>						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
